<Publisher title="Delivery & reader support — Scale of Us"><section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">READER SUPPORT</p><h1>A little help,<br /><em>before you begin.</em></h1></section><div class="prose-layout wrap"><aside><a href="#reading">Reading & listening</a><a href="#delivery">Shipping</a><a href="#returns">Returns & damage</a><a href="#privacy">Reviews & privacy</a></aside><article><section id="reading"><h2>Reading & listening</h2><p>Online reading is free. Choose English or Spanish and move at your own pace. For immersive reading, open the reader and press Listen. You can pause and choose a chapter.</p><p>If audio doesn’t start, press Listen again after checking your device’s sound settings. The text remains available while playback is paused.</p></section><section id="delivery"><h2>Shipping</h2><p>The signed printed edition ships within the United States. Shipping is $12 per order for one or two copies. Applicable sales tax is calculated at checkout. Orders normally dispatch within five business days, with tracking sent after the parcel leaves.</p><p>If an order cannot dispatch within the promised time, we will offer a revised shipping date. You may accept the delay or cancel the unshipped order for a full refund.</p>{!checkout.enabled && <p class="local-notice">The shop is not open yet. Checkout is being prepared.</p>}</section><section id="returns"><h2>Returns, damage & incorrect orders</h2><p>Because these are signed books from a small batch, sales are final for change of mind. Please report a damaged, defective, or incorrect book within 14 calendar days of delivery and include the order number and clear photographs.</p><p>We will replace the book when a copy is available. If replacement is unavailable, we will refund the book and its original shipping charge. Please wait for return instructions before sending anything back.</p></section><section id="privacy"><h2>Reviews & privacy</h2><p>A reviewer chooses their public name and the experience they’re reviewing. Contact details are private. Reviews from complimentary-copy recipients and readers who know the author carry those disclosures.</p><p>This local preview saves only a test review draft in your browser. It discards the email field and sends nothing to a server. You can delete the draft from the review form.</p><p>Before the live review form opens, we’ll publish the privacy notice, explain review moderation, and connect email verification and storage. Positive and critical reviews will follow the same moderation rules.</p></section></article></div></Publisher>
